.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/09/14/image.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てっ！  ほら、 海だよ！！\nねぇねぇねぇねぇ、海っっっっo( * ^o^ *)o ←無邪気なヤツ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神秘的な写真が撮れたので、なんだか感動ですっ。。＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/09/14/6569946/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海ってすごいね！大っきいね！(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事とかで来れなかったみなさんも、\nこれを見て癒されてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ上から見た夕日は、眩しくて、とってもキレイでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また立てるといいなっ( * ^_^ * )♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  さゆにゃんは陸上の試合とか見たことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊   お兄ちゃんが中高と陸上部だったので\nよく家族で応援に行ってました(* ^^ *)○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは～～ ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}}